        "Kagotsurube Isshin",
        "Prized Isshin Blade"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Akame Kanenaga: Kagotsurube Isshin",
      "content": "A 4-star sword described as blood-red and ominous, forged in Snezhnaya by Kanenaga using the Tatarigami. It has a mind of its own, born of its maker's remorse and the Tatarigami's malice, and travelled to Inazuma bent on proving itself.\n\nIts description says the hamon looks like flowing blood and tears in moonlight. On the way home the blade used humans as tools, possessing them until they were of no use. By the time it reached Inazuma its power was greatly diminished.",
