        "Case of the Eccentric"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Akame Kanenaga: Case of the Eccentric",
      "content": "About a century ago, Scaramouche (Kunikuzushi) arranged for the Isshin Art smiths to fail the Raiden Shogun's commission by tampering with the blueprint. Many fled to Snezhnaya, Kaedehara Yoshinori ended the family forge, and the Isshin Art lost its standing. The Kamisato were spared after Yae Miko intervened.",
